detaileddescription.para:
For every key in File::get() writes "stem.lua" to
@c File::path if not already present on disk. Then writes theme
lua files (@c File::Theme::get()) to the active theme directory
@c ~/.config/end/themes/\<name\>/, and every
@c File::Graphics stem (e.g. @"tab_bar.svg") to the graphics subdirectory inside that theme directory. Files already on disk are left untouched — this is a seed-once walk, not a forced overwrite.
